{"text":"So, let me start off by saying that I have for a long time now been arguing that the challenge of economic growth is the defining challenge of our time. In particular, as a frame of reference, in order for an economy to double per capita incomes and to essentially put a dent in poverty, an economy needs to be growing by at least 3% per year. Not only are countries that are developed like the United Kingdom struggling to attain that 3% number, but across the emerging markets the largest economies that have at least 50 million people are also struggling. Places like Brazil, Argentina, South Africa and across parts of Asia.","words":[{"text":"So","start":0.0,"end":0.98,"punct":","},{"text":"let","start":0.98,"end":1.34},{"text":"me","start":1.34,"end":1.48},{"text":"start","start":1.48,"end":1.74},{"text":"off","start":1.74,"end":1.92},{"text":"by","start":1.92,"end":2.1},{"text":"saying","start":2.1,"end":2.62},{"text":"that","start":2.62,"end":3.34},{"text":"I","start":3.34,"end":3.82},{"text":"have","start":3.82,"end":4.04},{"text":"for","start":4.04,"end":4.46},{"text":"a","start":4.46,"end":4.68},{"text":"long","start":4.68,"end":4.9},{"text":"time","start":4.9,"end":5.36},{"text":"now","start":5.36,"end":5.78},{"text":"been","start":5.78,"end":6.18},{"text":"arguing","start":6.18,"end":6.78},{"text":"that","start":6.78,"end":7.72},{"text":"the","start":7.72,"end":7.92},{"text":"challenge","start":7.92,"end":8.4},{"text":"of","start":8.4,"end":8.66},{"text":"economic","start":8.66,"end":9.14},{"text":"growth","start":9.14,"end":9.54},{"text":"is","start":9.54,"end":9.9},{"text":"the","start":9.9,"end":10.34},{"text":"defining","start":10.34,"end":11.04},{"text":"challenge","start":11.04,"end":11.76},{"text":"of","start":11.76,"end":12.48},{"text":"our","start":12.48,"end":12.72},{"text":"time","start":12.72,"end":13.1,"punct":"."},{"text":"In","start":14.46,"end":14.74},{"text":"particular","start":14.74,"end":15.2,"punct":","},{"text":"as","start":15.6,"